-terms\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/keywords-explorer/get-related-terms\"},{\"title\":\"Search suggestions\",\"description\":\"Keywords Explorer -  Keyword ideas MCP search-suggestions /search-suggestions\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/keywords-explorer/get-search-suggestions\"},{\"title\":\"Project Health Scores\",\"description\":\"Site Audit - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Projects MCP projects /projects\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/site-audit/get-projects\"},{\"title\":\"Page content\",\"description\":\"Site Audit - \u003eThis endpoint consumes a fixed cost of 50 API units per request. Page content MCP page-content /page-content\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/site-audit/get-page-content\"},{\"title\":\"Project Issues\",\"description\":\"Site Audit - \u003eThis endpoint consumes a fixed cost of 50 API units per request. Projects MCP issues /issues\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/site-audit/get-issues\"},{\"title\":\"Page explorer\",\"description\":\"Site Audit - \u003eThis endpoint consumes a fixed cost of 50 API units per request. Page explorer MCP page-explorer /page-explorer\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/site-audit/get-page-explorer\"},{\"title\":\"Overview\",\"description\":\"Rank Tracker - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Overview MCP overview /overview\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/rank-tracker/get-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Competitors overview\",\"description\":\"Rank Tracker - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Competitors Overview MCP competitors-overview /competitors-overview\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/rank-tracker/get-competitors-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Competitors pages\",\"description\":\"Rank Tracker - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Competitors Overview MCP competitors-pages /competitors-pages\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/rank-tracker/get-competitors-pages\"},{\"title\":\