- \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. AI visibility MCP ai-responses /ai-responses\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-ai-responses\"},{\"title\":\"Impressions\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. Overview MCP impressions-overview /impressions-overview\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/get-impressions-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Impressions\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. Overview MCP impressions-overview /impressions-overview\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-impressions-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Citations\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing.\\n\\nEvery entity provided in `brands` (and `competitors`, when applicable) must include at least one value in `url_groups`. Entities consisting only of `names` are not supported here because citations are matched against URL groups. Overview MCP citations-overview /citations-overview\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-citations-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Mentions\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. Overview MCP mentions-overview /mentions-overview\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/get-mentions-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Mentions\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing.\\n\\nEvery entity provided in `brands` (and `competitors`, when applicable) must include at least one value in `names`. Entities consisting only of `url_groups` are not supported here because mentions are matched against brand names. Overview MCP mentions-overview /mentions-overview\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-mentions-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Share of Voice\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. Overview MCP sov-overview /sov-overview\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/get-sov-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Share of Voice\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. Overview MCP sov-overview /sov-overview\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-sov-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Impressions\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. Overview history MCP impressions-history /impressions-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/get-impressions-history\"},{\"title\":\"Impressions\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. Overview history MCP impressions-history /impressions-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-impressions-history\"},{\"title\":\"Citations\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing.\\n\\nEvery entity provided in `brands` (and `competitors`, when applicable) must include at least one value in `url_groups`. Entities consisting only of `names` are not supported here because citations are matched against URL groups. Overview history MCP citations-history /citations-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-citations-history\"},{\"title\":\"Mentions\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. Overview history MCP mentions-history /mentions-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/get-mentions-history\"},{\"title\":\"Mentions\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing.\\n\\nEvery entity provided in `brands` (and `competitors`, when applicable) must include at least one value in `names`. Entities consisting only of `url_groups` are not supported here because mentions are matched against brand names. Overview history MCP mentions-history /mentions-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-mentions-history\"},{\"title\":\"Share of Voice\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. Overview history MCP sov-history /sov-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/get-sov-history\"},{\"title\":\"Share of Voice\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. Overview history MCP sov-history /sov-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-sov-history\"},{\"title\":\"Topics\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. AI visibility MCP Enterprise only topics /topics\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-topics\"},{\"title\":\"Cited Pages\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. AI visibility MCP cited-pages /cited-pages\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/get-cited-pages\"},{\"title\":\"Cited Pages\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. AI visibility MCP cited-pages /cited-pages\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-cited-pages\"},{\"title\":\"Cited Domains\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. AI visibility MCP cited-domains /cited-domains\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/get-cited-domains\"},{\"title\":\"Cited Domains\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - \u003eRequests to this endpoint consume API units based on the `prompts` parameter: requests returning only custom prompt data are free, while requests including Ahrefs prompt data follow standard API unit pricing. AI visibility MCP cited-domains /cited-domains\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-cited-domains\"},{\"title\":\"Web Pages\",\"description\":\"Brand Radar - Returns web pages that mention the requested brands or competitors. Brand mentions are matched against page titles and content from Ahrefs' web index. Web visibility MCP Enterprise only web-pages /web-pages\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/brand-radar/post-web-pages\"},{\"title\":\"Topics\",\"description\":\"Content Helper - \u003eThis endpoint consumes a base amount of 1000 units per request, plus 500 units if you request a URL to score.\\n\\n\u003eThe analysis runs on demand against the pages currently ranking for the keyword, so the first request for a keyword takes a few seconds. Results are cached, and repeat requests are served from the cache free of charge.\\n\\n\u003eOnly SERPs Ahrefs has already collected are used, and no new SERP is collected. If we have collected a SERP for the keyword and country in the last 90 days, the endpoint returns a `400` error and no units are consumed. Topics MCP topics /topics\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/content-helper/get-topics\"},{\"title\":\"Stats\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Overview MCP stats /stats\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-stats\"},{\"title\":\"Chart\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Overview MCP chart /chart\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-chart\"},{\"title\":\"Browsers\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. User Agents MCP browsers /browsers\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-browsers\"},{\"title\":\"Browsers Chart\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. User Agents MCP browsers-chart /browsers-chart\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-browsers-chart\"},{\"title\":\"Browser Versions\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. User Agents MCP browser-versions /browser-versions\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-browser-versions\"},{\"title\":\"Browser Versions Chart\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. User Agents MCP browser-versions-chart /browser-versions-chart\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-browser-versions-chart\"},{\"title\":\"Cities\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Geography MCP cities /cities\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-cities\"},{\"title\":\"Cities Chart\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Geography MCP cities-chart /cities-chart\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-cities-chart\"},{\"title\":\"Continents\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Geography MCP continents /continents\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-continents\"},{\"title\":\"Continents Chart\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not cons