\"},{\"title\":\"Source Channels Chart\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Traffic Sources MCP source-channels-chart /source-channels-chart\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-source-channels-chart\"},{\"title\":\"Sources\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Traffic Sources MCP sources /sources\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-sources\"},{\"title\":\"Sources Chart\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Traffic Sources MCP sources-chart /sources-chart\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-sources-chart\"},{\"title\":\"Referrers\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Traffic Sources MCP referrers /referrers\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-referrers\"},{\"title\":\"Referrers Chart\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Traffic Sources MCP referrers-chart /referrers-chart\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-referrers-chart\"},{\"title\":\"Top Pages\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Pages MCP top-pages /top-pages\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-top-pages\"},{\"title\":\"Top Pages Chart\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Pages MCP top-pages-chart /top-pages-chart\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-top-pages-chart\"},{\"title\":\"UTM Parameters\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Traffic Sources MCP utm-params /utm-params\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-utm-params\"},{\"title\":\"UTM Parameters Chart\",\"description\":\"Web Analytics - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Traffic Sources MCP utm-params-chart /utm-params-chart\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/web-analytics/get-utm-params-chart\"},{\"title\":\"Performance history\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Overview MCP performance-history /performance-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-performance-history\"},{\"title\":\"Positions history\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Overview MCP positions-history /positions-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-positions-history\"},{\"title\":\"Pages history\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Overview MCP pages-history /pages-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-pages-history\"},{\"title\":\"Performance by device\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Overview MCP performance-by-device /performance-by-device\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-performance-by-device\"},{\"title\":\"Metrics by country\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Overview MCP metrics-by-country /metrics-by-country\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-metrics-by-country\"},{\"title\":\"CTR by position\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Overview MCP ctr-by-position /ctr-by-position\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-ctr-by-position\"},{\"title\":\"Performance by position\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Overview MCP performance-by-position /performance-by-position\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-performance-by-position\"},{\"title\":\"Keyword history\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Keywords MCP keyword-history /keyword-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-keyword-history\"},{\"title\":\"Keywords\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Keywords MCP keywords /keywords\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-keywords\"},{\"title\":\"Page history\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Pages MCP page-history /page-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-page-history\"},{\"title\":\"Pages\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Pages MCP pages /pages\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-pages\"},{\"title\":\"Anonymous queries\",\"description\":\"GSC Insights -  Anonymous queries MCP anonymous-queries /anonymous-queries\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/gsc/get-anonymous-queries\"},{\"title\":\"Channels\",\"description\":\"Social Media - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Channels MCP channels /channels\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/social-media/get-channels\"},{\"title\":\"Authors\",\"description\":\"Social Media - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Posts MCP authors /authors\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/social-media/get-authors\"},{\"title\":\"Activity history\",\"description\":\"Social Media - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Posts MCP activity-history /activity-history\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/social-media/get-activity-history\"},{\"title\":\"Posts\",\"description\":\"Social Media - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Posts MCP posts /posts\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/social-media/get-posts\"},{\"title\":\"Channel metrics\",\"description\":\"Social Media - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Channels MCP channel-metrics /channel-metrics\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/social-media/get-channel-metrics\"},{\"title\":\"Post metrics\",\"description\":\"Social Media - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Posts MCP post-metrics /post-metrics\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/social-media/get-post-metrics\"},{\"title\":\"Create post\",\"description\":\"Social Media - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Posts post /post\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/social-media/post-post\"},{\"title\":\"Delete post\",\"description\":\"Social Media - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Posts post /post\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/social-media/delete-post\"},{\"title\":\"Update post\",\"description\":\"Social Media - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not consume any API units. Posts post /post\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/social-media/patch-post\"},{\"title\":\"Crawler IP addresses\",\"description\":\"Public - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not require an API key. Crawler MCP crawler-ips /crawler-ips\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/public/get-crawler-ips\"},{\"title\":\"Crawler IP ranges\",\"description\":\"Public - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free and do not require an API key. Crawler MCP crawler-ip-ranges /crawler-ip-ranges\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/public/get-crawler-ip-ranges\"},{\"title\":\"Domain rating free\",\"description\":\"Public - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free, yet require an APIv3 key.\\n\\n\u003eAPIv3 keys are free to generate and use. If you don't have an Ahrefs account, here's how to get the key for free:\\n\u003e1. [Sign up](https://ahrefs.com/) for a free Ahrefs account (if you don't have one)\\n\u003e2. Generate an API key in [Account settings → API keys](https://app.ahrefs.com/account/api-keys)\\n\u003e3. Add it to your requests: `Authorization: Bearer \u003ctoken\u003e`\\n\\nUse of this data is subject to the Domain Rating License at http://ahrefs.com/legal/domain-rating-license. Attribution required: \\\"Domain Rating by Ahrefs\\\" (https://ahrefs.com/). Domain Rating MCP domain-rating-free /domain-rating-free\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/public/get-domain-rating-free\"},{\"title\":\"Domain rating free\",\"description\":\"Public - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free, yet require an APIv3 key.\\n\\n\u003eAPIv3 keys are free to generate and use. If you don't have an Ahrefs account, here's how to get the key for free:\\n\u003e1. [Sign up](https://ahrefs.com/) for a free Ahrefs account (if you don't have one)\\n\u003e2. Generate an API key in [Account settings → API keys](https://app.ahrefs.com/account/api-keys)\\n\u003e3. Add it to your requests: `Authorization: Bearer \u003ctoken\u003e`\\n\\nUse of this data is subject to the Domain Rating License at http://ahrefs.com/legal/domain-rating-license. Attribution required: \\\"Domain Rating by Ahrefs\\\" (https://ahrefs.com/). Domain Rating MCP domain-rating-free /domain-rating-free\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/public/post-domain-rating-free\"},{\"title\":\"Domain rating top domains\",\"description\":\"Public - \u003eRequests to this endpoint are free, yet require an APIv3 key.\\n\\n\u003eAPIv3 keys are free to generate and use. If you don't have an Ahrefs account, here's how to get the key for free:\\n\u003e1. [Sign up](https://ahrefs.com/) for a free Ahrefs account (if you don't have one)\\n\u003e2. Generate an API key in [Account settings → API keys](https://app.ahrefs.com/account/api-keys)\\n\u003e3. Add it to your requests: `Authorization: Bearer \u003ctoken\u003e`\\n\\nReturns the top 1M domains ranked by Ahrefs Domain Rating, together with each domain's current Domain Rating.\\nUse `from` and `to` to request a range of rank positions. Each request can return up to 250k rows (e.g. `from=1\u0026to=250000`).\\n Domain Rating MCP domain-rating-top-domains /domain-rating-top-domains\",\"href\":\"/en/api/reference/public/get-domain-rating-top-domains\"},{\"title\":\"What is Ahrefs MCP\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/introduction\"},{\"title\":\"Tool Categories\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/tool-categories\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Desktop/Web\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/claude-desktop-web\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Mobile\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/claude-mobile\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/claude-code\"},{\"title\":\"Copilot Studio\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/copilot-studio\"},{\"title\":\"ChatGPT Web\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/chatgpt-web\"},{\"title\":\"Lovable\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/lovable\"},{\"title\":\"n8n\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/n8n\"},{\"title\":\"Manus\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/manus\"},{\"title\":\"Mistral's Le Chat\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/mistral-le-chat\"},{\"title\":\"OpenClaw\",\"description\":\"MCP\",\"href\":\"/en/mcp/docs/openclaw\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction\",\"description\":\"Data Studio\",\"href\":\"/en/looker-studio/docs/introduction\"},{\"title\":\"Create a data source using an Ahrefs connector\",\"description\":\"Data Studio\",\"href\":\"/en/looker-studio/docs/create-a-data-source\"},{\"title\":\"Reauthorize the Ahrefs connector\",\"description\":\"Data Studio\",\"href\":\"/en/looker-studio/docs/reauthorize-the-connector\"},{\"title\":\"Refresh the project/report list in the configuration menu\",\"description\":\"Data Studio\",\"href\":\"/en/looker-studio/docs/refresh-config-project-list\"},{\"title\":\"Brand Radar configuration\",\"description\":\"Data Studio\",\"href\":\"/en/looker-studio/docs/brand-rada